this room dishes of gold, silver, and rock crystal, some of the last named being purchased at fabulous prices.

Rich hangings and tapestries lent their aid toward making this an attractive apartment.

This profuseness of furnishings and ornamentation was noticeable throughout the entire house, but further descriptions are prohibited by a wish not to weary the reader, or detract from the interest of the story.

